e operations. Domain reload temporarily interrupts the listener, and Unity must service its main thread. The Claude Code bridge needs no separate provider API key; in-editor chat and image generation have separate API requirements.","limitations","What the source actually contains","Reviewed the exact Claude skill, loopback HttpListener implementation, and AssetTools.CreateScript. The skill calls the bridge's live schema, follows script writes with wait_for_compile, and checks capture_game_view.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[79],"evidenceUrl",{"_50":75,"_25":80},"https://github.com/TestcodeInc/ione/blob/5c668fb32efa7e832ce932f0536980b22808e3df/ClaudeSkill/SKILL.md","Code / instructions",[84],"codeUrl",{"_50":81,"_25":85},"https://github.com/TestcodeInc/ione/blob/5c668fb32efa7e832ce932f0536980b22808e3df/Editor/Core/IoneHttpBridge.cs","Primary source",[89],"sourceUrl",{"_50":86,"_25":90},"https://github.com/TestcodeInc/ione","Engine / runtime","Unity / C#","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[100],"agents","Claude Code","Toolkit category","Engine bridges","lead","summary","bridge",[108],"implementation","claude-code",{"_110":111},"documents",{"_112":113,"_114":115},"en",[117,121,122,123,120,124,125,126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,119,156,118,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177],"zh",[116,117,118,119,120],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-g